{
  "uid": "gesway-rabbitmq",
  "title": "Gesway — Mensageria (RabbitMQ)",
  "tags": [
    "gesway",
    "rabbitmq",
    "analytics"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Broker no ar",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "1 = o Prometheus alcança o rabbitmq:15692. 0 = broker fora: o outbox do core acumula até ele voltar",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"rabbitmq\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Fora"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "No ar"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Mensagens mortas (DLQ)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "analytics.core-events.dlq. Acima de 0 = evento que o analytics não aplicou (erro permanente ou 5 tentativas). Não volta sozinha: reprocessar é manual, depois de corrigir a causa (catálogo §5.3)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages{queue=\"analytics.core-events.dlq\"})",
          "legendFormat": "DLQ"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "sem dado"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Consumidores do analytics",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Consumidores na fila analytics.core-events. 0 = ninguém aplica os eventos: os indicadores param de atualizar",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_consumers{queue=\"analytics.core-events\"})",
          "legendFormat": "consumidores"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "sem dado"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Eventos esperando consumo",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Mensagens prontas na fila principal. Subindo sem parar = o analytics consome mais devagar do que o core publica",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages_ready{queue=\"analytics.core-events\"})",
          "legendFormat": "prontas"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1000
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "sem dado"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Profundidade por fila",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Total de mensagens em cada fila do analytics: principal, nova tentativa (espera de 10 s) e mensagens mortas",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (queue) (rabbitmq_queue_messages{queue=~\"analytics\\\\.core-events.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Fila principal — prontas × em processamento",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Prontas = esperando o consumidor. Em processamento = entregues e ainda sem ack. Prontas crescendo com consumidor ativo = atraso de consumo",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages_ready{queue=\"analytics.core-events\"})",
          "legendFormat": "prontas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages_unacked{queue=\"analytics.core-events\"})",
          "legendFormat": "em processamento"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Vazão do broker",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Publicadas pelo core × entregues e confirmadas pelo analytics, por segundo. Publicadas acima de confirmadas por muito tempo = fila crescendo",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_received_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicadas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_delivered_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "entregues"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_acknowledged_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "confirmadas (ack)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "msg/s"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Ciclo de nova tentativa",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Dead-letter feito pelo próprio broker, por segundo. Rejeitadas = nack do analytics por erro transitório, indo para a espera de 10 s. Expiradas = fim da espera, voltando à fila principal. A ida para a DLQ não aparece aqui: o analytics publica em analytics.dlx (veja o painel Mensagens mortas)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_dead_lettered_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejeitadas (vão esperar)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_dead_lettered_expired_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "expiradas (voltam à fila)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "msg/s"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
